ammed workouts, personalized training plans, workout data, and more.<\/p>","link_url":"","link_text":"","link_style":"link","check-bg":"#000000","check-color":"#ffffff"}},"item_FWiCMj":{"type":"item","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/S15B2_Merach_4-in-1_Heimtrainer_Fahrrad_Schwarz_14.jpg","column_size":"3","title":"Easy to Move","heading_tag":"h4","content":"<p>The base of the fitness bike is equipped with wheels, eliminating the need for strenuous effort when moving the device.<\/p>","link_url":"","link_text":"","link_style":"link","check-bg":"#000000","check-color":"#ffffff"}},"item_cmGzgG":{"type":"item","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/S15B2_Merach_4-in-1_Heimtrainer_Fahrrad_Schwarz_15_085cb43e-3f40-4be6-ba5b-1655914821cf.jpg","column_size":"3","title":"Compatible Apps","heading_tag":"h4","content":"<p>Merach, Kinomap, Zwift, Apple Health, Google Fit, Fanton Fite (By Merach)<\/p>","link_url":"","link_text":"","link_style":"link","check-bg":"#000000","check-color":"#ffffff"}}},"block_order":["item_AUKXdT","item_NnRWkE","item_N6VwF3","item_HxLrkL","item_77zXwN","item_FWiCMj","item_cmGzgG"],"settings":{"full_width":true,"stack_on_mobile":false,"gap":"medium","text_alignment":"center","subheading":"","title":"","content":"","background":"","background_gradient":"","text_color":""}},"accordion_content_ABVBL4":{"type":"accordion-content","blocks":{"item_VcpLPc":{"type":"item","settings":{"icon":"none","icon_width":20,"title":"Controls and Functions","content":"<ul><li>Display: LCD<\/li><li>Flywheel Weight: 1.5 kg<\/li><li>Resistance Levels: 16<\/li><li>Resistance Type: Magnetic<\/li><li>Pedal Type: Adjustable<\/li><li>Auto Electromagnetic: No<\/li><li>Device Charging: Yes<\/li><li>Bluetooth: Yes<\/li><li>Accessory Holders: Phone\/Tablet Holder, Water Bottle Holder<\/li><\/ul>","page":""}},"item_NhAFCk":{"type":"item","settings":{"icon":"none","icon_width":20,"title":"Machine Dimensions","content":"<ul><li>Weight Capacity: 136 kg<\/li><li>Assem